Regular A's have a 5% chance of trying to make their rustproof long
sword into Sunsword or Demonbane. Archons have a 100% chance of trying
to make their rustproof long sword into Sunsword or Demonbane (usual
stuff about the odds when one not the other already exists etc here). 
Because it was not rustproof it did not come from that source.  You
probably found Sunsword on the floor likely in a shop.  It's possible it
came from a death drop not an initial inventory.

You can also tell if Demonbane is from a death drop versus initial
inventory the same way - rustproof means it was in the initial inventory
of some type of A.

